==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{defdate|1846}} From {{der|en|fr|psychiatrie}}, from {{der|en|ML.|psychiatria}}. Surface etymology is {{affix|en|psycho-|alt1=psych-|-iatry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/saɪˈkaɪ.əˌtɹi/}}
{{rfap|en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# {{lb|en|medicine}} The branch of [[medicine]] that subjectively [[diagnose]]s, treats, and studies mental disorders and [[behavioural]] conditions.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|psychiatric}}
* {{l|en|psychiatrist}}

